<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Hi&nbsp;{!Lead.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,&nbsp;</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">It was great speaking with you about your working capital needs. I look forward to funding your business soon.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Per our conversation, I need the following in order to move forward with your business loan application: &nbsp;</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Last 3 months of business bank statements (all pages)&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Most recent business tax return (2013/2014, top page)&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Signed and completed application&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As soon as I receive your statements, I will call you to discuss next steps. I look forward to continue working with you.</font></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sincerely,</span></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!User.Name}</span><br><b>National Funding</b><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!User.Title}</span><br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=HotProspect">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email: {!User.Email}</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>